"""Writes the byte tables of the Ponte specs from the readable lists below.

Each spec carries one generated block between
    ; >>> generated by Specs/tables/ponte_tables.py ...
    ; <<< generated
The block holds named row indexes and the rows as packed UTF-8 bytes with offsets and lengths
(t27 has no string arrays that reach C). Run by Specs/generate.sh; edit the lists here, not the specs.

- device_rules.t27: the words the device and app rules look for, the known call apps (sorted by bundle ID,
  with their labels; they must equal AudioApp.knownCallApps in Sources/PonteCore/Contracts.swift), the
  FaceTime companion processes, and the texts its tests use.
- segment_rules.t27, voice_rules.t27, transcript_rules.t27: the texts their tests use.
"""
